{
  "key": 39268,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it to Pewter!\r",
        "We met in Oak’s lab, but here I’m a Gym\n",
        "Leader, and you’re a challenger.\r",
        "Show me what your Rock Pokémon can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Good to see you again.\r",
        "Since Oak’s lab, I’ve wondered how your\n",
        "Normal types would do against my Rock\f",
        "types.\r",
        "Let’s find out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Well, well. The kid from Oak’s lab.\r",
        "A Water trainer, here to take the Water\n",
        "Gym’s Badge? Ha!\r",
        "Let’s see you try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! The Electric kid\n",
        "from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "This is my turf, soldier. Let’s see who’s\n",
        "packing more voltage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid! Told you I’d be\n",
        "watching.\r",
        "Let’s see if that armor holds up under\n",
        "fire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… Welcome. I’m so\n",
        "glad you came.\r",
        "I’ve been looking forward to seeing your\n",
        "Grass Pokémon again.\r",
        "Shall we?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …You have come, as I knew you\n",
        "would.\r",
        "I have watched you from the shadows\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now show me your Poison in the open!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! The Bug trainer from\n",
        "Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Most call Bug Pokémon weak. Show me why\n",
        "they are wrong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …I saw this battle in a vision,\n",
        "the day we met in Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Psychic trainers. Only one leaves\n",
        "with the win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said we\n",
        "would.\r",
        "Show me whether your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you as much as I foresaw."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz! Who’s the Fire trainer\n",
        "I met in Oak’s lab?\r",
        "Answer: you! Now let’s see if you can\n",
        "take the heat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ErikaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello…\n",
        "Lovely weather, isn’t it?\f",
        "It’s so pleasant…\r",
        "…Oh, dear…\n",
        "I must have dozed off. Welcome.\r",
        "My name is Erika.\n",
        "I am the Leader of Celadon Gym.\r",
        "I am a student of the art of\n",
        "flower arranging.\r",
        "My Pokémon are solely of the\n",
        "Grass type.\r",
        "…Oh, I’m sorry, I had no idea that\n",
        "you wished to challenge me.\r",
        "Very well, but I shall not lose."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_GymAides_Text_CeladonCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide here!\n",
        "Erika’s Gym shows off her plants.\f",
        "Trees and hedges make great walls.\r",
        "A tree you can cut can hide a\n",
        "shortcut, so only challengers with\f",
        "the right tool can take it.\r",
        "Visitors should know this is a\n",
        "Grass-type Gym before they ever\f",
        "meet Erika!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Erika\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ErikaPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "You are cataloging Pokémon?\n",
        "I must say I’m impressed.\r",
        "I would never collect Pokémon if\n",
        "they were unattractive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_GymAides_Text_CeladonCityAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "With the Rainbow Badge, your Gym PC\n",
        "sells Ferns from Erika’s Gym.\r",
        "And the Pallet Town Mart now stocks\n",
        "Silver Bottle Caps. A Leader’s team\f",
        "should reach its full potential!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Erika\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ExplainRainbowBadgeTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "The Rainbowbadge will make\n",
        "Pokémon up to Lv. 50 obey.\r",
        "It also allows Pokémon to use\n",
        "Strength in and out of battle.\r",
        "Please also take this with you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM19FromErika",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM19\n",
        "from Erika."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM19",
      "en_US": [
        "TM19 contains Giga Drain.\r",
        "Half the damage it inflicts is\n",
        "drained to heal your Pokémon.\r",
        "Wouldn’t you agree that it’s a\n",
        "wonderful move?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_GymHack_Text_ErikaSilverCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Please, accept this as well.\n",
        "It’s from the Pokémon League."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ShouldMakeRoomForThis",
      "en_US": "You should make room for this."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_GymHack_Text_ErikaCilantro",
      "en_US": [
        "And this is from my own garden.\r",
        "I grow Cilantro in the Gym’s\n",
        "greenhouse.\r",
        "Some people adore its scent, and\n",
        "some can’t stand it at all…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_GymHack_Text_ErikaCilantroAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "Much like perfume, a single sniff\n",
        "can change a Pokémon’s nature.\r",
        "Choose the nature that suits it,\n",
        "the way one chooses a fragrance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
